    "searchText": "foxwell enforcement careercontract orange lvl. contract: defend foxwell_defenddestructibleentities_stanton_medium foxwell enforcement careercontract standing pickup: stanton i'm hoping that you'll be able to provide protection services at [location]. one of our high priority clients is having some real trouble with a band of outlaws targeting their [objects]. need to be able to keep the assets as safe and intact as possible. client’s expecting the service they pay for, so don’t mess this up or we might lose a loyal customer.\n\nfor now, we’re still a little in the dark when it comes to these outlaws, but if you manage to nail this to the foxwell standards, we’re offering  [scripamount] mg scrip to the main contractor. \n\ngood luck,\n\nkevin walton\ndispatcher, foxwell enforcement\n'security, your way'\n\nfoxwell enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the uee. we are always looking for new operators to join our family. if you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives. orange lvl. contract: protect red lvl. contract: defend red lvl. contract: protect yellow lvl. contract: defend yellow lvl. contract: protect 7bf79c80-7d57-471f-a1af-77c08ec7f9b6 378bfd37-57d5-4a7e-a0e8-efce6d1d278b 9588e6f4-f0db-4c81-a959-901c3ef3509c 7c6dd9c4-b73b-4b61-9117-c11b4c074dac 1e67d50d-ce82-4e46-b0f9-140b6df64fb7 659c9aa2-7bef-4498-97d8-9eb643bc02f6 blueprint: foxwell defend entities and escort: parallax energy assault rifle, antium arms, antium core, antium legs +2 standing +150 credits formula unresolved item reward: mg scrip completion tag standing +200 standing +250 standing +300"
